{
  "title": "Vergelijking",
  "path": "vergelijking",
  "icon": "mdi:scale-balance",
  "type": "sections",
  "max_columns": 4,
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "column_span": 4,
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Dynamisch tegenover Groene Burgerstroom",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "icon": "mdi:scale-balance"
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Read-only vergelijking op basis van de Ecopower-entiteiten van de integratie *BE electricity prices*. Alle prijzen zijn all-in (energie + netwerk + taxen, incl. btw). Deze tab stuurt niets aan.",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Afnameprijs nu",
          "heading_style": "subtitle",
          "icon": "mdi:transmission-tower-import"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs",
          "name": "Dynamisch",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          },
          "icon": "mdi:flash"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs",
          "name": "Groene Burgerstroom",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          },
          "icon": "mdi:leaf"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_prijs_volgend_uur",
          "name": "Dynamisch · volgend uur",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_prijs_volgend_uur",
          "name": "Groene · volgend uur",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Injectieprijs nu",
          "heading_style": "subtitle",
          "icon": "mdi:transmission-tower-export"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_injectieprijs",
          "name": "Dynamisch",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          },
          "icon": "mdi:flash"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_injectieprijs",
          "name": "Groene Burgerstroom",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          },
          "icon": "mdi:leaf"
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "**Vandaag gemiddeld (all-in)**  \nDynamisch: {{ states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_gemiddelde_vandaag')|float(0)|round(3) }} €/kWh · Groene Burgerstroom: {{ states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_gemiddelde_vandaag')|float(0)|round(3) }} €/kWh  \n{% set d = states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_gemiddelde_vandaag')|float(0) - states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_gemiddelde_vandaag')|float(0) %}Dynamisch is vandaag gemiddeld **{{ (d|abs*100)|round(1) }} c€/kWh {{ 'duurder' if d > 0 else 'goedkoper' }}** dan Groene Burgerstroom.\n\n**Goedkoopste kwartier vandaag:** {{ states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_minimum_vandaag')|float(0)|round(3) }} · **duurste:** {{ states('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_maximum_vandaag')|float(0)|round(3) }} €/kWh  \n{% if is_state('binary_sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_prijzen_voor_morgen_beschikbaar','on') %}Prijzen voor morgen zijn binnen.{% else %}Prijzen voor morgen volgen (meestal rond 13u).{% endif %}  \nTariefkaart Ecopower: dynamisch {{ state_attr('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs','snapshot_publication') }} · Groene Burgerstroom {{ state_attr('sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs','snapshot_publication') }}",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Kosten",
          "heading_style": "subtitle",
          "icon": "mdi:cash"
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_kost_deze_maand",
          "name": "Dynamisch · deze maand",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_kost_deze_maand",
          "name": "Groene · deze maand",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_kost_dit_jaar",
          "name": "Dynamisch · dit jaar",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "tile",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_kost_dit_jaar",
          "name": "Groene · dit jaar",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 6,
            "rows": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Capaciteit",
          "heading_style": "subtitle",
          "icon": "mdi:gauge"
        },
        {
          "type": "gauge",
          "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_maandelijkse_vermogenspiek",
          "name": "Maandpiek (kW)",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 10,
          "segments": [
            {
              "from": 0,
              "color": "#43a047"
            },
            {
              "from": 5,
              "color": "#ffa600"
            },
            {
              "from": 7,
              "color": "#db4437"
            }
          ],
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 12,
            "rows": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "**Maandpiek** telt mee in de capaciteitskost. De grens van 7 kW is de gezamenlijke importlimiet die ook de dry-run planner gebruikt.",
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": 12,
            "rows": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "column_span": 4,
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "heading": "Prijsverloop vandaag en morgen",
          "heading_style": "title",
          "icon": "mdi:chart-line"
        },
        {
          "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
          "header": {
            "show": true,
            "title": "Afnameprijs (€/kWh, all-in)",
            "show_states": true,
            "colorize_states": true
          },
          "graph_span": "48h",
          "span": {
            "start": "day"
          },
          "now": {
            "show": true,
            "label": "nu"
          },
          "yaxis": [
            {
              "decimals": 3,
              "min": 0
            }
          ],
          "apex_config": {
            "stroke": {
              "width": 2
            },
            "legend": {
              "show": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "x": {
                "format": "ddd HH:mm"
              }
            },
            "chart": {
              "height": 300
            }
          },
          "series": [
            {
              "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs",
              "name": "Dynamisch",
              "type": "line",
              "curve": "stepline",
              "stroke_width": 2,
              "data_generator": "const a=(entity.attributes.today||[]).concat(entity.attributes.tomorrow||[]); return a.map(r=>[new Date(r.start).getTime(), r.all_in]);",
              "extend_to": false,
              "float_precision": 3
            },
            {
              "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_huidige_prijs",
              "name": "Groene Burgerstroom",
              "type": "line",
              "curve": "stepline",
              "stroke_width": 2,
              "data_generator": "const a=(entity.attributes.today||[]).concat(entity.attributes.tomorrow||[]); return a.map(r=>[new Date(r.start).getTime(), r.all_in]);",
              "extend_to": false,
              "float_precision": 3
            }
          ],
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "custom:apexcharts-card",
          "header": {
            "show": true,
            "title": "Injectieprijs (€/kWh)",
            "show_states": true,
            "colorize_states": true
          },
          "graph_span": "48h",
          "span": {
            "start": "day"
          },
          "now": {
            "show": true,
            "label": "nu"
          },
          "yaxis": [
            {
              "decimals": 3,
              "min": 0
            }
          ],
          "apex_config": {
            "stroke": {
              "width": 2
            },
            "legend": {
              "show": true
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "x": {
                "format": "ddd HH:mm"
              }
            },
            "chart": {
              "height": 300
            }
          },
          "series": [
            {
              "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_dynamische_burgerstroom_flanders_injectieprijs",
              "name": "Dynamisch",
              "type": "line",
              "curve": "stepline",
              "stroke_width": 2,
              "data_generator": "const a=(entity.attributes.today||[]).concat(entity.attributes.tomorrow||[]); return a.map(r=>[new Date(r.start).getTime(), r.injection]);",
              "extend_to": false,
              "float_precision": 3
            },
            {
              "entity": "sensor.ecopower_ecopower_groene_burgerstroom_flanders_injectieprijs",
              "name": "Groene Burgerstroom",
              "type": "line",
              "curve": "stepline",
              "stroke_width": 2,
              "data_generator": "const a=(entity.attributes.today||[]).concat(entity.attributes.tomorrow||[]); return a.map(r=>[new Date(r.start).getTime(), r.injection]);",
              "extend_to": false,
              "float_precision": 3
            }
          ],
          "grid_options": {
            "columns": "full",
            "rows": "auto"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
